[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13320.55, "timestamp": "03:42:00", "text": "プロ意識に欠けることとか、例えば私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13324.63, "timestamp": "03:42:04", "text": "企業の立場に立っていた状況で"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13327.91, "timestamp": "03:42:07", "text": "もし私がちゃんとした企業に勤めていて、公に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13330.229, "timestamp": "03:42:10", "text": "私はコーポレートで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13332.309, "timestamp": "03:42:12", "text": "画面共有や私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13335.269, "timestamp": "03:42:15", "text": "このようなデスクトップは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13337.11, "timestamp": "03:42:17", "text": "私が持つマイナスポイントと私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13340.55, "timestamp": "03:42:20", "text": "マネージャーまたはタレントマネージャーは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13342.55, "timestamp": "03:42:22", "text": "残念だった。私の中に。私は手に入れるだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13345.03, "timestamp": "03:42:25", "text": "彼らから散々お説教されるだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13347.67, "timestamp": "03:42:27", "text": "配信を終了します。そういうことなんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13349.91, "timestamp": "03:42:29", "text": "なぜなら、覚えておいて、そうしなければならないから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13353.11, "timestamp": "03:42:33", "text": "最高のプロフェッショナル。そして、ありのままの自分でいることも大切です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13355.19, "timestamp": "03:42:35", "text": "そこにはたくさんのものがある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13357.349, "timestamp": "03:42:37", "text": "これに至るのは、またあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13359.51, "timestamp": "03:42:39", "text": "貴社を代表して。あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13363.83, "timestamp": "03:42:43", "text": "会社で働く。あなたの行動"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13367.349, "timestamp": "03:42:47", "text": "行動は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13370.59, "timestamp": "03:42:50", "text": "会社のイメージ。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13372.989, "timestamp": "03:42:52", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "who cares I didn't even knew this stuff I have been called out 2 times so far and 4 times in old channel my 1 channel is shadow banned"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13373.95, "timestamp": "03:42:53", "text": "いいえ、たくさんありますよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13377.389, "timestamp": "03:42:57", "text": "いいえ、私がどうやって全部知っているのか聞かないでください"}]